{"job_id":"F-b44425543ce5ee242375","family_id":"F-b44425543ce5ee242375","title":"공군군수사령부령","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002267-205313-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":8,"target_id":"5a3bb35b7e4c38f1812bbfcd7651421013b6c2ea3f3743398e94503073150bcf","source_hash":"899b85a23f1be023f5f4bfa1ef935db78348cac0edbf0e3b9ecce7e08a57da86","text":"空军后勤司令部命令"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002267-205313-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":202,"target_id":"2bffed2200566f2f6b73c3810cfa0ae07d732626bb91bd92e0c6506393b92fa9","source_hash":"d65716ea65887d355231afd24d4153dc697d064913a1e70f2f82d99c271928b5","text":"第一条（设施和任务）\n① 在空军内设立空军后勤司令部（以下简称“后勤司令部”）。\n后勤司令部负责后勤保障相关事宜，例如军用飞机和空军特种车辆、电力设备和通信设备的维护，以及军事物资的采购、供应和运输。\n③ 除了第 2 款规定的职责外，后勤司令部还可以为国内民用飞机和外国飞机（包括军用飞机）提供维护保障服务，以换取丰厚的报酬。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002267-205313-ko","scope":"BODY","start":202,"end":235,"target_id":"853aad6b00d5352b5df7decbdfc0e111a146089865825a06e8d8ad1fe89530dd","source_hash":"4907ab60a260cb4ebd2c4ac00ad3da03baeade65a69e5ff6ee73dfa2e516b2e4","text":"第二条（地点）后勤司令部的地点由空军参谋长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002267-205313-ko","scope":"BODY","start":235,"end":465,"target_id":"6a5a779c3f12f74d4a77c76c8c6ebcf4ccd9bbc15356e280d129493a5f95814c","source_hash":"4ac52de55abb56ab127e72bb303cd147ccf079e4e521ef549cb0997edda566e8","text":"第三条（指挥官）\n应任命一名指挥官担任后勤司令部司令。\n② 司令官由总统根据国防部长的提议，并依据空军参谋长的建议，从空军将官中任命。<2017年9月5日修订>\n③ 司令官在空军参谋长的命令下，监督后勤司令部的运作，并指挥和监督附属单位（包括分配给后勤司令部的单位）的后勤保障。\n④指挥官缺席时，由参谋部军衔最高的长官代行其职责。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002267-205313-ko","scope":"BODY","start":465,"end":591,"target_id":"b5c096884f4f40d7646e34a1c2300db10ee16c85fd92525b7cad8ff93a58d7df","source_hash":"268db4d6c07b4db0479193d5937ca78e9666ebb3c418126fb5a62e8d68a866a4","text":"第四条（部门和单位的设立）\n①在后勤司令部内建立必要的部门和单位。\n② 第1款所述各部门的设立和职责划分的必要事项，由空军参谋长决定；各单位的设立、任务和组织的必要事项，由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002267-205313-ko","scope":"BODY","start":591,"end":710,"target_id":"3fa88dcd815603c8805f009646a4fbc3ee04146bcda639a50fd8fbd6d599a1f6","source_hash":"c85e5ea1193ee06ea34471d5eef8e7ddbe929318006c48b0e63d7acacbd24d08","text":"第五条（维护军纪）司令官应当维护和执行空军参谋长指定区域内（以下简称“管辖区域”）空军部队的军纪。但是，由空军参谋长指定的空军部队除外。<2018年12月4日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002267-205313-ko","scope":"BODY","start":710,"end":899,"target_id":"c64c1de58ca5154f802c0c0f4a41d03c96c0dcf218a1fedc5228276f08c33f45","source_hash":"6bcb2dcf6abb289a8179e1a7d1a9099d9ab1d6dd3327534d3399396a2dd81f1e","text":"第六条（对其他单位的临时指挥和监督）\n① 当因军事、疾病控制或灾害等紧急情况需要时，指挥官可以暂时指挥和监督其管辖范围内不属于其所属部队的空军部队。\n② 指挥官按照第1款规定行使临时指挥和监督权的，应当立即向空军参谋长报告情况，并同时通知有关部队的上级指挥官。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002267-205313-ko","scope":"BODY","start":899,"end":985,"target_id":"39a3c4ed431c08934544a9808efc15af2df2612ca17f2e3a293baf99378c0b7a","source_hash":"375e1038b9b681fe7885dbb7c7537db47641721d3fe118e7238dda28ad536499","text":"第七条（后勤司令部搬迁的事先批准）  当司令因灾害、疾病控制或军事需要而拟搬迁后勤司令部时，必须获得空军参谋长的批准。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002267-205313-ko","scope":"BODY","start":985,"end":1032,"target_id":"caac89aef492389e67b2795c41aa3327155912a13ab190d89eae53d6781cda8a","source_hash":"96117f8c8d8df57a79385b728af62e7c1dc60df3abe0145a48203b6f6634fc4f","text":"第八条（人员配额）后勤司令部应配备军事人员和文职人员，人员配额由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002267-205313-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1032,"end":1077,"target_id":"2fb41c36f1791033796e70d170c0da224e972c2eedbe8d81595fe52c543d9de9","source_hash":"904c367f3c919b3239b320a8306862feed46c81b426ae866ebb2b596dcbb57d8","text":"补充条款 <第11051号，1983年2月12日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002267-205313-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1077,"end":1110,"target_id":"1c2f5a9a219020c07c7543490ec90c531597e216a1c7f0c30548c8d681b98458","source_hash":"46ae83072f863724fe582dfad77d64d08ffc2625dcab5f104235e03aafc9074d","text":"补充条款（《军事人员法》实施令》）<第28266号，2017年9月5日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002267-205313-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1110,"end":1147,"target_id":"07e0a76e3293b3a16279c7421a12addbd3136608a10abd21bcfb23b9b0c887de","source_hash":"7d7075d3fab665cdbaac560b14335b0ee552583c1a51db7e92e263494f72f34f","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002267-205313-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1147,"end":1161,"target_id":"18563dee9855ae1006c953b0c5bb11663ebb3129e4b3ef07645c35638e702d3e","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"条款 2 和 3 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002267-205313-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1161,"end":1272,"target_id":"4be7030c3814e057553e8050b39a7d0fd4355f166d0e362311d182941a71ca6e","source_hash":"8a7925915f0a1a2ff5c6a35f2f70007f33bba95c67a2ba214594a24023f9383c","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）①至⑤ 省略\n\n  6. 对空军后勤司令部命令的部分内容修改如下。\n\n  第3条第2款中的“部级”应改为“总级”。\n\n  从⑦ 跳至 <90>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002267-205313-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1272,"end":1304,"target_id":"f0b5e53ced67700c9d6ec35318b158355a6a0bcf31701cd9bf42cdd73bb2d8cb","source_hash":"de588adf60e2b9ab1eae09f068dfaec85007d837e2e47e4243decc39ddef51a7","text":"增补（作战指挥令）<编号 29321，2018 年 12 月 4 日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002267-205313-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1304,"end":1339,"target_id":"5215e4d13bf98e2264574d73c6941ad2436262b2255f2c9fb6a9d2e49e973940","source_hash":"cd0498143f8ddb81f650d569a11c16e832dab70e6930facb820e7b6bf2e62145","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自2019年1月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002267-205313-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1339,"end":1347,"target_id":"08ce308d3bae55b0a2902f91566649556470fddb1823d54c5fbe61a4f703aafa","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"第 2 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002267-205313-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1347,"end":1403,"target_id":"e25a518b29d90cbbf0ebce44d78fbacc5fbb10845e6920037d089b55ae9a8f94","source_hash":"384e6cbf35ab25c75c44d467195807d627c534238a237f9b0aee2da8d3f660ac","text":"第三条（修改其他法律）①和②已省略\n\n  ③ 空军后勤司令部命令部分内容修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002267-205313-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1403,"end":1455,"target_id":"feae7c2e37eb2428bdc266cec395e04c191e58acb92dcf24f2411c9b34e3c8e9","source_hash":"f7e49896ba2fcbeacd9e41febf9546d2629b1a84e14da6a285bfc86945e714fa","text":"  第五条正文中的“Gunpunggi”应改为“Gungi（軍紀）”。  \n\n  省略④至<16>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002267-205313-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1455,"end":1461,"target_id":"936bffc26b65f308f093e2a845d9fc2ec4a791f53f894a8f31b8cc6a42547faa","source_hash":"558c6d17486d0d6657212a87561377425c0a8eb8bdfabed29d681808202e17af","text":"第 4 条省略"}]}